#MM- includes-vesagfx: kernel-hidd-vesagfx-includes
#MM- includes-vesagfx_rel : kernel-hidd-vesagfx-includes
#MM- kernel-hidd-vesagfx : kernel-hidd-vesagfx-includes core-linklibs linklibs-
#MM kernel-hidd-vesagfx-linklib : kernel-hidd-vesagfx-includes includes-
#MM- kernel-hidd-vesagfx-quick : kernel-hidd-vesagfx-includes-quick
#MM kernel-hidd-vesagfx-includes : kernel-hidd-vesagfx-makefile kernel-hidd-vesagfx-includes-dirs \
